line\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>ASTRAL_KNOWLEDGE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Astral_Knowledge\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Knowledge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Knowledge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Knowledge (Condition)\">Astral Knowledge</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in all Skills of a chosen Ability.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Astral_Knowledge:_Charisma\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge:_Charisma_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Knowledge: Charisma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Knowledge: Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge:_Charisma_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Knowledge: Charisma (Condition)\">Astral Knowledge: Charisma</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in Deception, Intimidation, Performance, and Persuasion.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Astral_Knowledge:_Dexterity\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge:_Dexterity_(Condition)\" title=\"Astral Knowledge: Dexterity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Knowledge: Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=